			<item>
				<title>Dream Dream - 키 더 메탈 아이돌 (最終 ED c/w)</title>
				<link>https://ezaurum.com/2009/04/Dream-Dream-%ED%82%A4-%EB%8D%94-%EB%A9%94%ED%83%88-%EC%95%84%EC%9D%B4%EB%8F%8C-%E6%9C%80%E7%B5%82-ED-c-w/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2009 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://ezaurum.com/2009/04/Dream-Dream-%ED%82%A4-%EB%8D%94-%EB%A9%94%ED%83%88-%EC%95%84%EC%9D%B4%EB%8F%8C-%E6%9C%80%E7%B5%82-ED-c-w/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/RYYKVpvnvXA?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ごめんね　友だちだけど&lt;br&gt;&#xA;미안해 친구인데도&lt;br&gt;&#xA;きょうは　わけはきかないで&lt;br&gt;&#xA;오늘은 왜그런지 묻지 마&lt;br&gt;&#xA;きょうは　ちょっと元氣ない&lt;br&gt;&#xA;오늘은 조금 기운이 없네&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ほんとはちょっとじゃないけど&lt;br&gt;&#xA;사실은 조금이 아니지만&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ごめんね　なんのことだか&lt;br&gt;&#xA;미안해 무슨 일인지&lt;br&gt;&#xA;わからないと思うけど&lt;br&gt;&#xA;이해안될거 같지만서도&lt;br&gt;&#xA;なにをしても お手上げで&lt;br&gt;&#xA;뭘 해도 잘 안 되어서&lt;br&gt;&#xA;なにも できる ことがない&lt;br&gt;&#xA;뭘 할 수 있는게 없어&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;なにをしても ダメなら 寢るしかないよね&lt;br&gt;&#xA;뭘 해도 안된다면 잘 수 밖에는 없잖아&lt;br&gt;&#xA;まだこんな 時間だけど．&lt;br&gt;&#xA;아직 이런 시간이지만&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ん∼ 電話を 切ったら　カ－テンを 閉めて&lt;br&gt;&#xA;응~ 전화를 끊으면 커튼을 닫고&lt;br&gt;&#xA;パジャマに きがえて　Ｄｒｅａｍ　Ｄｒｅａｍ&lt;br&gt;&#xA;파자마로 갈아입고　Dream Dream&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>才悩人応援歌(재뇌인응원가) - BUMP OF CHICKEN</title>
				<link>https://ezaurum.com/2009/02/%E6%89%8D%E6%82%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%9C%E6%8F%B4%E6%AD%8C%EC%9E%AC%EB%87%8C%EC%9D%B8%EC%9D%91%EC%9B%90%EA%B0%80-BUMP-OF-CHICKEN/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 12 Feb 2009 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://ezaurum.com/2009/02/%E6%89%8D%E6%82%A9%E4%BA%BA%E5%BF%9C%E6%8F%B4%E6%AD%8C%EC%9E%AC%EB%87%8C%EC%9D%B8%EC%9D%91%EC%9B%90%EA%B0%80-BUMP-OF-CHICKEN/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/2x8uxa0ksDw?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;才悩人応援歌(재뇌인응원가) - BUMP OF CHICKEN&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;得意な事があった事 今じゃもう忘れてるのは&lt;br&gt;&#xA;토쿠이나코토가앗-타코토 이마쟈모-와스레테루노와&lt;br&gt;&#xA;재주를 갖고 있던 사실을 이제는 잊어버린 건&lt;br&gt;&#xA;それを自分より 得意な誰かが居たから&lt;br&gt;&#xA;소레오지분-요리 토쿠이나다레카가이타카라&lt;br&gt;&#xA;그것을 나보다 잘하는 누군가가 있기에&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ずっと前から解ってた 自分のための世界じゃない&lt;br&gt;&#xA;즛-토마에카라와캇-테타 지분-노타메노세카이쟈나이&lt;br&gt;&#xA;훨씬 전부터 알고 있었죠 나를 위한 세상이 아니라는 걸&lt;br&gt;&#xA;問題無いでしょう 一人くらい 寝てたって&lt;br&gt;&#xA;몬-다이나이데쇼- 히토리쿠라이 네테탓-테&lt;br&gt;&#xA;아무 문제 없잖아요 한사람정도 자고 있었다해도&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>100 Years - Five for Fighting</title>
				<link>https://ezaurum.com/2009/02/100-Years-Five-for-Fighting/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2009 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://ezaurum.com/2009/02/100-Years-Five-for-Fighting/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/qgN5TnQ23vs?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I&amp;rsquo;m 15 for a moment&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Caught in between 10 and 20&lt;br&gt;&#xA;And I&amp;rsquo;m just dreaming&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Counting the ways to where you are&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I&amp;rsquo;m 22 for a moment&lt;br&gt;&#xA;She feels better than ever&lt;br&gt;&#xA;And we&amp;rsquo;re on fire&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Making our way back from Mars&lt;br&gt;&#xA;15 there&amp;rsquo;s still time for you&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Time to buy and time to lose&lt;br&gt;&#xA;15, there&amp;rsquo;s never a wish better than this&lt;br&gt;&#xA;When you only got 100 years to live&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I&amp;rsquo;m 33 for a moment&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Still the man, but you see I&amp;rsquo;m a they&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A kid on the way&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A family on my mind&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I&amp;rsquo;m 45 for a moment&lt;br&gt;&#xA;The sea is high&lt;br&gt;&#xA;And I&amp;rsquo;m heading into a crisis&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Chasing the years of my life&lt;br&gt;&#xA;15 there&amp;rsquo;s still time for you&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Time to buy, Time to lose yourself&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Within a morning star&lt;br&gt;&#xA;15 I&amp;rsquo;m all right with you&lt;br&gt;&#xA;15, there&amp;rsquo;s never a wish better than this&lt;br&gt;&#xA;When you only got 100 years to live&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Half time goes by&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Suddenly you&amp;rsquo;re wise&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Another blink of an eye&lt;br&gt;&#xA;67 is gone&lt;br&gt;&#xA;The sun is getting high&lt;br&gt;&#xA;We&amp;rsquo;re moving on&amp;hellip;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I&amp;rsquo;m 99 for a moment&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Dying for just another moment&lt;br&gt;&#xA;And I&amp;rsquo;m just dreaming&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Counting the ways to where you are&lt;br&gt;&#xA;15 there&amp;rsquo;s still time for you&lt;br&gt;&#xA;22 I feel her too&lt;br&gt;&#xA;33 you&amp;rsquo;re on your way&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Every day&amp;rsquo;s a new day&amp;hellip;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;15 there&amp;rsquo;s still time for you&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Time to buy and time to choose&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Hey 15, there&amp;rsquo;s never a wish better than this&lt;br&gt;&#xA;When you only got 100 years to live&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
