part&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I&amp;rsquo;ll promise her the moon&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I&amp;rsquo;ll promise her the moon&lt;br&gt;&#xA;And all the time she stood by me&lt;br&gt;&#xA;I never said &amp;ldquo;I love you&amp;rdquo;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Yeah, I kept it deep down in my soul&lt;br&gt;&#xA;And all the while I&amp;rsquo;ve been a fool&lt;br&gt;&#xA;yeah, yeah yeah.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
